OL,3,CFamilies pay tribute to four young men
OL,4,Ckilled in Huyton crash
OL,6,FThe families of four young men killed
OL,7,Fin a car crash in Huyton have paid
OL,8,Ftribute to them.
OL,10,FJack Diggle, 23, Benjamin Dooley, 23,
OL,11,FAndrew Roberts, 24, and Craig
OL,12,FShackleton-Brady, 26, were travelling
OL,13,Fin a black Cupra Formentor in the
OL,14,FHuyton area of Merseyside at 2am on
OL,15,FFriday when the car left the road and
OL,16,Fcollided with a lamppost on Liverpool
OL,17,FRoad.
OL,19,FThey were pronounced dead at the scene
OL,20,Fwhile a fifth passenger, 27, was
OL,21,Frushed to hospital.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/10
