PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785154708
OL,3,CFamilies pay tribute to four young men
OL,4,Ckilled in Huyton crash
OL,6,FThe families of the four men have now
OL,7,Fpaid tribute to them- describing them
OL,8,Fas "thoughtful", "loving" and
OL,9,F"beautiful".
OL,11,FJack Diggle's mother said: "Jack was
OL,12,Fkind, quiet, thoughtful, and loving.
OL,13,FHe adored his family, and we loved him
OL,14,Fwith all our hearts.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785154708
OL,3,CFamilies pay tribute to four young men
OL,4,Ckilled in Huyton crash
OL,6,FJack was blessed with a wonderful
OL,7,Fgroup of friends, many of whom had
OL,8,Fbeen by his side for most of his life.
OL,9,FHe loved playing football with them
OL,10,Fand was a proud Everton supporter. He
OL,11,Falso had a passion for darts, whether
OL,12,Fhe was watching it or playing himself.
OL,13,FIn fact, he was due to travel to
OL,14,FBlackpool today with his friends to
OL,15,Fwatch the darts, something he had been
OL,16,Flooking forward to.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785154708
OL,3,CFamilies pay tribute to four young men
OL,4,Ckilled in Huyton crash
OL,6,F"Jack and I went out for a meal
OL,7,Ftogether on Thursday. It was such a
OL,8,Flovely time, just mother and son,
OL,9,Fenjoying each other's company. Little
OL,10,Fdid I know that it would be the last
OL,11,Ftime we would spend together.
OL,13,F"The loss of Jack has left a hole in
OL,14,Four lives and in our hearts that can
OL,15,Fnever be filled. We will carry him
OL,16,Fwith us every day and miss him for the
OL,17,Frest of our lives.
OL,19,F"Our Jack, our gentle giant, we love
OL,20,Fyou beyond words and will love you
OL,21,Fforever. Rest peacefully, son."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
