OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785154708
OL,3,CFamilies pay tribute to four young men
OL,4,Ckilled in Huyton crash
OL,6,FAndrew Roberts' mother Linda said: My
OL,7,Fbeautiful blue-eyed boy, I can't
OL,8,Fbelieve I'm having to even write this.
OL,9,FMy sweetheart boy could never do no
OL,10,Fwrong, my life will never be the same
OL,11,Fwith you not here. My heart will
OL,12,Fforever be broken. I love you son,
OL,13,Ffrom mum."
OL,15,FThe family of Craig Shackleton-Brady
OL,16,Fadded: "Craig was a truly well-
OL,17,Fmannered family man whose love,
OL,18,Floyalty, and generosity touched
OL,19,Feveryone who knew him.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
