FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785154708
OL,3,CFamilies pay tribute to four young men
OL,4,Ckilled in Huyton crash
OL,6,FSuperintendent Paul Holden from
OL,7,FMerseyside Police said: "First and
OL,8,Fforemost our thoughts are with the
OL,9,Ffamily of the four men who sadly lost
OL,10,Ftheir lives following the collision in
OL,11,Fthe early hours of this morning.
OL,13,F"Their families have been informed and
OL,14,Fare being supported by our specially
OL,15,Ftrained family liaison officers.
OL,17,F"This is a truly devastating moment
OL,18,Ffor their families and loved ones, and
OL,19,Fit is now our priority to get answers
OL,20,Ffor them on how the collision occurred.
OL,26,@oD@YOUuD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
